[2026-03-14T21:03:13.067Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WjMpzpkaoonEAv4tNVAEdb","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile my comprehensive findings:\n\n## Summary of LinearClone App - Login Functionality Investigation\n\n### 1. **App Directory Name**\n- **`/repo/apps/LinearClone`**\n\n### 2. **Contents of docs/tests.md** (Test Entries)\nThe file is comprehensive with 930+ lines covering:\n\n**Login Form Tests** (9 tests):\n- Login form renders with email and password fields\n- Successful login with valid credentials\n- Login fails with invalid email\n- Login fails with incorrect password\n- Login form validates required fields\n- Login form validates email format\n- Navigate to sign up page from login\n- Password field masks input\n- Login form can be submitted via Enter key\n- Login redirects authenticated users\n\n**Sign Up Form Tests** (11 tests):\n- Sign up form renders with name, email, and password fields\n- Successful account creation\n- Sign up fails with existing email\n- Sign up form validates required fields\n- Sign up form validates email format\n- Sign up form validates password minimum length\n- Navigate to login page from sign up\n- Password field masks input on sign up\n- Sign up form can be submitted via Enter key\n- Sign up redirects authenticated users\n\n**Navigation Sidebar Tests** (42+ tests covering):\n- Sidebar rendering and navigation\n- Team sections with collapsible behavior\n- Workspace section navigation\n- Keyboard shortcuts (C, G+I, G+N)\n- Active link highlighting\n- Notification badges\n\n**My Issues, Inbox, Team Issues, Issue Detail, etc.** - Additional comprehensive test specifications\n\n### 3. **Contents of AppSpec.md (Spec File)**\nComplete project specification including:\n- Core concepts (Workspace, Team, Project, Issue, Cycle, Label, Member)\n- Authentication section: \"Simple email-based authentication (no OAuth). Users sign up with name, email, and password. On first login, a default workspace is created. Sessions are managed via a session token stored in localStorage.\"\n- Pages: Login, Sign Up, My Issues, Inbox, Team Issues, Issue Detail, Projects, Members, Teams, Labels, Settings\n- Issue statuses and priorities with icons/colors\n- Navigation sidebar structure\n- Keyboard shortcuts\n- Visual design specifications (dark mode, color scheme `#5e6ad2` primary accent)\n\n### 4. **Playwright Config File**\n**Path:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from '@playwright/test';\nimport { replayDevices, replayReporter } from '@replayio/playwright';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: './tests',\n  timeout: 60000,\n  expect: { timeout: 10000 },\n  fullyParallel: false,\n  forbidOnly: true,\n  retries: 0,\n  workers: 1,\n  reporter: [\n    replayReporter({ upload: false }),\n    ['json', { outputFile: 'test-results/results.json' }],\n    ['html', { open: 'never' }],\n  ],\n  use: {\n    ...replayDevices['Replay Chromium'],\n    baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888',\n    actionTimeout: 15000,\n  },\n  webServer: {\n    command: 'npx netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions',\n    port: 8888,\n    reuseExistingServer: false,\n    timeout: 30000,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### 5. **Existing Test Files**\n- **Tests directory exists but is empty:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/` (0 files)\n- No `.spec.ts` files currently in the src directory\n\n### 6. **Login Page Component & Auth-Related Components**\n\n**LoginForm Component:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/LoginForm.tsx`\n- Email and password input fields with validation\n- Email format validation via regex: `/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/`\n- Required field validation\n- Error display from Redux state\n- Loading state with button disable\n- Link to signup page\n- Dispatches `login` async thunk from authSlice\n- Test IDs for Playwright: `login-form`, `login-email-input`, `login-password-input`, `login-submit-button`, `login-signup-link`, `login-error`, etc.\n\n**SignUpForm Component:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SignUpForm.tsx`\n- Name, email, password input fields\n- Email validation: `/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/`\n- Password minimum 8 characters validation\n- Error display\n- Loading state\n- Link to login page\n- Dispatches `signup` async thunk\n- Test IDs: `signup-form`, `signup-name-input`, `signup-email-input`, `signup-password-input`, `signup-submit-button`, etc.\n\n**Auth Slice (Redux):** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts`\n- `login` thunk: POST to `/api/login` with email/password\n- `signup` thunk: POST to `/api/signup` with name/email/password\n- `fetchCurrentUser` thunk: GET from `/api/me` with Bearer token\n- Token stored in localStorage as `session_token`\n- Auth state includes: user (id, name, email), token, loading, error\n- Session token expiry: 30 days\n- Logout action clears user, token, and localStorage\n\n### 7. **Netlify Functions - Auth Related**\n\n**Login Function:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/login.ts`\n- POST endpoint\n- Input validation: email and password required\n- Queries members table for matching email\n- Uses PBKDF2 password hashing (10000 iterations, SHA-512)\n- Generates session token (48 bytes random hex)\n- Creates session with 30-day expiry\n- Returns user object (id, name, email) and token\n- Error responses: 400 (missing fields), 401 (invalid credentials), 405 (wrong method), 500 (server error)\n\n**Signup Function:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/signup.ts`\n- POST endpoint\n- Input validation: name, email, password required\n- Password minimum 8 characters validation\n- Checks for existing email (409 conflict if exists)\n- Generates salt and hashes password using PBKDF2\n- Creates member with 'admin' role\n- Creates default workspace if none exists\n- Creates session and returns user + token\n- 30-day session expiry\n\n**Current User (Me) Function:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/me.ts`\n- GET endpoint\n- Bearer token required in Authorization header\n- Validates token and checks expiry (expires_at > NOW)\n- Returns current user (id, name, email)\n- Errors: 401 (unauthorized, session expired), 405 (wrong method), 500 (server error)\n\n**DB Utility:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n```typescript\nimport { neon } from '@neondatabase/serverless';\n\nexport function getSql() {\n  return neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL!);\n}\n```\nUses Neon (serverless PostgreSQL) for database connection\n\n### 8. **Database Schema & Seed Data**\n\n**Schema File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/schema.ts`\n\nTables created (relevant to auth):\n- **`workspaces`**: id (UUID), name (TEXT), default_team_id (UUID FK)\n- **`members`**: id (UUID), name (TEXT), email (UNIQUE TEXT), password_hash (TEXT), password_salt (TEXT), role (TEXT, default 'member'), created_at (TIMESTAMP)\n- **`sessions`**: token (TEXT PK), member_id (UUID FK), expires_at (TIMESTAMP)\n\nAdditional tables:\n- teams, team_members, labels, projects, cycles, issues, issue_labels, comments, activity, notifications, project_milestones, project_activity\n\n**Indexes created:**\n- idx_sessions_member_id (for fast session lookups)\n- idx_issues_assignee_id, idx_issues_team_id, idx_issues_project_id, idx_issues_cycle_id, idx_issue_labels_issue_id, idx_team_members_team_id, idx_comments_issue_id, idx_activity_issue_id, idx_notifications_member_id, etc.\n\nNo separate seed.sql file exists - schema is initialized programmatically via `initSchema()` function\n\n### 9. **Database Connection File**\n**Path:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/db.ts` (already shown above)\n\nUses `@neondatabase/serverless` library with Neon connection string from `DATABASE_URL` environment variable\n\n---\n\n## Key Authentication Features:\n1. Email/password authentication (no OAuth)\n2. PBKDF2 password hashing with salt (10,000 iterations, SHA-512)\n3. Session tokens stored in localStorage\n4. 30-day token expiry\n5. Bearer token validation via `/api/me`\n6. Default workspace creation on signup\n7. Admin role for first user signup\n8. Comprehensive validation on both client and server\n\nAll relevant files are in `/repo/apps/LinearClone` with login/auth logic in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/` (UI), `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/` (state management), and `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/` (backend API)."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ac0a23cae96ea7f0f (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 65988\ntool_uses: 26\nduration_ms: 47056</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cea1a0db-f072-4eb0-98ad-c0869b93e80c","uuid":"67bfa467-e8b2-407e-b31f-2d68d1c3bc81","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app in /repo/apps/ that has login functionality. I need:\n1. The app directory name\n2. Contents of docs/tests.md (the test entries)\n3. Contents of docs/spec.md or similar spec files\n4. The playwright config file\n5. Any existing test files (*.spec.ts)\n6. The login page component and auth-related components\n7. The netlify functions related to auth/login\n8. Contents of the seed.sql or similar seed data file\n9. The db.ts file in netlify/functions/\n\nBe thorough - read all relevant files. Focus on login/auth related code.","agentId":"ac0a23cae96ea7f0f","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me compile my comprehensive findings:\n\n## Summary of LinearClone App - Login Functionality Investigation\n\n### 1. **App Directory Name**\n- **`/repo/apps/LinearClone`**\n\n### 2. **Contents of docs/tests.md** (Test Entries)\nThe file is comprehensive with 930+ lines covering:\n\n**Login Form Tests** (9 tests):\n- Login form renders with email and password fields\n- Successful login with valid credentials\n- Login fails with invalid email\n- Login fails with incorr