[2026-03-14T21:05:01.898Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014hUjEWAXDSFVwVvVkfqkac","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 10 login tests have been written in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/login.spec.ts` and the Playwright config has been fixed. Here's a summary of what was done:\n\n**Tests written** (all in `tests/login.spec.ts`):\n1. **Login form renders with email and password fields** — verifies email input, password input, Sign in button, and Sign up link are visible\n2. **Successful login with valid credentials** — creates a user via API, logs in, verifies redirect to `/my-issues`, localStorage token, and sidebar visibility\n3. **Login fails with invalid email** — enters nonexistent email, verifies error message and no redirect\n4. **Login fails with incorrect password** — uses seeded user with wrong password, verifies error\n5. **Login form validates required fields** — clicks submit with empty fields, verifies both validation errors\n6. **Login form validates email format** — enters \"notanemail\", verifies format validation error\n7. **Navigate to sign up page from login** — clicks Sign up link, verifies URL and signup page content\n8. **Password field masks input** — verifies input type is \"password\"\n9. **Login form can be submitted via Enter key** — creates user, fills form, presses Enter, verifies redirect\n10. **Login redirects authenticated users** — sets valid token in localStorage, navigates to `/login`, verifies redirect to `/my-issues`\n\n**Playwright config fixes:**\n- Changed `fullyParallel: false` → `true`\n- Removed `workers: 1`\n- Removed `webServer` section (test script handles server lifecycle)\n\nAll tests use `data-testid` selectors, generous timeouts for auth flows, `test.slow()` for multi-step flows, and `Date.now()` suffixes for unique test data.\n\n<DONE>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":445,"cache